cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HuePrint, its probe batteries, or its empirical cloud response datasets, please cite this work."
title: "Talk Is Cheap, Show Me Your Colors: Low-Budget Consistency Auditing for Aggregated LLM Services"
type: article
version: "2.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
license: CC-BY-4.0
